<view class="page {{senior?'senior':''}} {{reducedMotion?'reduced-motion':''}}">
  <view class="step-count">第 {{step+1}} / 9 步</view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{progress}}%"></view></view>
  <view class="page-title">{{stepTitle}}</view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{storageError}}">{{storageError}}</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="status danger" wx:if="{{urgent}}"><view class="status-title">先停止训练，寻求医疗帮助</view><view>胸痛、严重气促、晕厥或明显咯血时，立即让身边的人协助，必要时拨打 120。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{step===0}}"><image class="step-image" src="/assets/chapters/assessment.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="field"><label class="field-label" for="age">年龄（岁）</label><input id="age" class="input" type="number" maxlength="3" value="{{draft.age}}" data-field="age" bindinput="setField" placeholder="请输入年龄" aria-label="年龄，岁" /></view><view class="field-help">不需要填写姓名、手机号或身份证。</view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{step===1}}"><view class="page-intro">按医护已经告诉你的诊断选择。</view><view class="options"><button wx:for="{{diseases}}" wx:key="id" class="option {{draft.disease===item.id?'selected':''}}" data-field="disease" data-value="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose" hover-class="press-lift"><view class="option-label">{{item.label}}</view></button></view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{step===2}}"><view class="options"><button wx:for="{{stabilities}}" wx:key="id" class="option {{draft.stability===item.id?'selected':''}}" data-field="stability" data-value="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose" hover-class="press-lift"><view class="option-label">{{item.label}}</view><view class="option-detail">{{item.detail}}</view></button></view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{step===3}}"><view class="page-intro">是否经过医护评估，允许目前的轻量居家训练？</view><view class="options"><button class="option {{draft.clinicianCleared===true?'selected':''}}" data-value="yes" bindtap="choosePermission" hover-class="press-lift">已经允许</button><button class="option {{draft.clinicianCleared===false?'selected':''}}" data-value="no" bindtap="choosePermission" hover-class="press-lift">还没有 / 不确定</button></view><view class="field-help">还没有也可以保存评估，先阅读照护知识。</view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{step===4}}"><button class="btn-quiet" bindtap="noFlags" hover-class="press-lift">以上症状都没有</button><view wx:for="{{flagRows}}" wx:key="id" class="field"><view class="field-label">{{item.label}}</view><view class="button-row"><button class="option {{item.value===true?'selected':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-value="yes" bindtap="chooseFlag" hover-class="press-lift">有</button><button class="option {{item.value===false?'selected':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-value="no" bindtap="chooseFlag" hover-class="press-lift">没有</button></view></view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{step===5}}"><view class="page-intro">只填你已有的结果，不会填可以跳过。</view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">呼吸困难量表</view><picker range="{{scaleNames}}" value="{{scaleIndex}}" bindchange="chooseScale"><view class="input">{{scaleNames[scaleIndex]}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><label class="field-label">呼吸困难总分</label><input class="input" type="number" value="{{draft.dyspneaScore}}" data-field="dyspneaScore" bindinput="setField" placeholder="没有结果可留空" /></view><view class="field" wx:if="{{draft.disease==='asthma'}}"><label class="field-label">ACT 已有总分（5–25）</label><input class="input" type="number" value="{{draft.act}}" data-field="act" bindinput="setField" placeholder="没有结果可留空" /></view><view class="field" wx:if="{{draft.disease==='copd'}}"><label class="field-label">CAT 已有总分（0–40）</label><input class="input" type="number" value="{{draft.cat}}" data-field="cat" bindinput="setField" placeholder="没有结果可留空" /></view><view class="status warning">跳过专业评分可以保存资料；开始训练前仍可能需要医护复核。</view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{step===6}}"><view class="page-intro">看得懂报告就填，不确定的先留空。</view><view class="field"><label class="field-label">FEV₁ / 预计值（%）</label><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{draft.fev1Percent}}" data-field="fev1Percent" bindinput="setField" placeholder="例如：60；不是升数" /></view><view class="field"><label class="field-label">FEV₁ / FVC（%）</label><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{draft.fev1Fvc}}" data-field="fev1Fvc" bindinput="setField" placeholder="没有结果可留空" /></view><view class="field"><label class="field-label">静息 SpO₂（%）</label><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{draft.spo2}}" data-field="spo2" bindinput="setField" placeholder="没有测量可留空" /></view><button class="btn-quiet" bindtap="reports" hover-class="press-lift">有报告，保存在本机</button><view class="field-help">不上传报告，也不自动推断其中的数值。</view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{step===7}}"><view class="options"><button wx:for="{{goals}}" wx:key="id" class="option {{draft.goal===item.id?'selected':''}}" data-field="goal" data-value="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose" hover-class="press-lift">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
  <view wx:else><view class="panel"><view class="summary-row" wx:for="{{summary}}" wx:key="label"><view class="field-help">{{item.label}}</view><view>{{item.value}}</view></view></view><view class="privacy-line">保存后仅保留在当前微信的本机空间。换手机不会自动同步。</view></view>
  <view class="button-row"><button wx:if="{{step>0}}" class="btn-secondary" bindtap="previous" hover-class="press-lift">上一步</button><button class="btn-primary" bindtap="next" hover-class="press-lift">{{step===8?'保存评估':'下一步'}}</button></view>
  <button wx:if="{{step===5||step===6}}" class="link-button" bindtap="skip">这一步先不填</button>
</view>
